    "3. Calculate the **median population** and divide the dataset into two groups:\n",
    "   - **Larger cities**: population ≥ median\n",
    "   - **Smaller cities**: population < median\n",
    "4. Create separate scatterplots for each group, comparing:\n",
    "   - x-axis = `mental distress %`\n",
    "   - y-axis = `std dev temp`\n",
    "   - hue = `year`"
